From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Grische <github@grische.xyz>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 19:10:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] powerpc: mpc85xx: relocate remaining simpleImage devices

Link the simpleImage loader of HiveAP-330, BR200-WP and WS-AP3715i at
0x3000000, so their kernels no longer exceed the space available below
the loader.

Signed-off-by: Grische <github@grische.xyz>
---
--- a/arch/powerpc/boot/wrapper
+++ b/arch/powerpc/boot/wrapper
@@ -349,6 +349,13 @@ simpleboot-ws-ap3825i)
     link_address='0x3000000'
     binary=y
     ;;
+simpleboot-br200-wp|\
+simpleboot-hiveap-330|\
+simpleboot-ws-ap3715i)
+    platformo="$object/fixed-head.o $object/simpleboot.o"
+    link_address='0x3000000'
+    binary=y
+    ;;
 simpleboot-*)
     platformo="$object/fixed-head.o $object/simpleboot.o"
     binary=y
